WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.647
The next module moves from joins to subqueries A
join combines

00:00:05.674 --> 00:00:10.189
row sets directly A subquery lets one query use the
result of

00:00:10.216 --> 00:00:15.397
another query as part of its logic You will see
subqueries used

00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:21.437
for membership questions existence checks
comparisons with summary values and intermediate
analytical

00:00:21.463 --> 00:00:27.317
steps The join skills from this module still matter
When

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:31.212
you decide between a join a subquery or a common
table expression

00:00:31.396 --> 00:00:37.170
you should continue asking about grain cardinality
and clarity Before

00:00:37.183 --> 00:00:40.499
moving on make sure you can explain the difference
between matching and

00:00:40.525 --> 00:00:44.933
preservation and make sure you understand why
multiple child tables can multiply

00:00:44.959 --> 00:00:49.686
rows Those ideas will continue to help as the SQL
becomes more

00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:50.383
expressive
